<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Robert Horry Approach: Trading for Rings, Not Highlights | DRVN Ecosystem Post 10/10</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Crimson+Pro:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --court-green: #1d3f2a;
            --championship-gold: #d4af37;
            --deep-burgundy: #4a1a1f;
            --cream: #f4f1e8;
            --charcoal: #2a2a2a;
            --accent-orange: #e67e22;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Crimson Pro', serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--deep-burgundy) 0%, var(--court-green) 100%);
            color: var(--cream);
            line-height: 1.7;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .grain-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="300" height="300"><filter id="noise"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.9" numOctaves="4" /></filter><rect width="100%" height="100%" filter="url(%23noise)" opacity="0.05" /></svg>');
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
            animation: grain 8s steps(10) infinite;
        }

        @keyframes grain {
            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            10% { transform: translate(-5%, -10%); }
            20% { transform: translate(-15%, 5%); }
            30% { transform: translate(7%, -25%); }
            40% { transform: translate(-5%, 25%); }
            50% { transform: translate(-15%, 10%); }
            60% { transform: translate(15%, 0%); }
            70% { transform: translate(0%, 15%); }
            80% { transform: translate(3%, 35%); }
            90% { transform: translate(-10%, 10%); }
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 60px 30px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            animation: fadeInDown 1s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInDown {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .series-label {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            color: var(--championship-gold);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 0.2s both;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; }
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px);
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--cream);
            text-shadow: 4px 4px 0px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 0.4s both;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--championship-gold);
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: 400;
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 0.6s both;
        }

        .championship-rings {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 30px 0 50px;
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 0.8s both;
        }

        .ring {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border: 3px solid var(--championship-gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4), transparent);
            position: relative;
            animation: ringGlow 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .ring::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background: var(--championship-gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        }

        .ring:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0s; }
        .ring:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
        .ring:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
        .ring:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.9s; }
        .ring:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 1.2s; }
        .ring:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 1.5s; }
        .ring:nth-child(7) { animation-delay: 1.8s; }

        @keyframes ringGlow {
            0%, 100% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
                transform: scale(1);
            }
            50% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.6), 0 0 30px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
                transform: scale(1.15);
            }
        }

        .content {
            background: rgba(42, 42, 42, 0.85);
            border: 2px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 50px 45px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 1s both;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(40px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .content p {
            font-size: 19px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            color: var(--cream);
            text-align: left;
        }

        .content p:first-of-type::first-letter {
            font-size: 72px;
            line-height: 60px;
            float: left;
            margin: 5px 15px 0 0;
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            color: var(--championship-gold);
        }

        .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15), transparent);
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--championship-gold);
            margin-left: -11px;
            padding-left: 8px;
        }

        .quote-box {
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--championship-gold);
            padding: 30px 35px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--championship-gold);
            position: relative;
        }

        .quote-box::before {
            content: '"';
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 120px;
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            left: 10px;
            opacity: 0.2;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .stat-card {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }

        .stat {
            background: rgba(29, 63, 42, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .stat:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--championship-gold);
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 48px;
            color: var(--championship-gold);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.7);
        }

        .closing {
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding-top: 40px;
            border-top: 2px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .closing p {
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--championship-gold);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .signature {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: var(--cream);
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                padding: 40px 20px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 35px 25px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 42px;
            }

            .subtitle {
                font-size: 18px;
            }

            .content p {
                font-size: 17px;
            }

            .quote-box {
                font-size: 19px;
                padding: 25px 25px;
            }

            .stat-card {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .drvn-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--championship-gold);
            color: var(--deep-burgundy);
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 15px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>
    
    <div class="container">
        <header class="header">
            <div class="series-label">Trading Philosophy Series – Final Chapter</div>
            <h1>The Robert Horry Approach</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">Trading for Rings, Not Highlights</div>
            <div class="championship-rings">
                <div class="ring"></div>
                <div class="ring"></div>
                <div class="ring"></div>
                <div class="ring"></div>
                <div class="ring"></div>
                <div class="ring"></div>
                <div class="ring"></div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="content">
            <p>When I first stepped into the world of trading, I saw a lot of folks aiming to be like the Michael Jordans or the Kobe Bryants of the market—the kind of traders who want to be the star players, front and center, making the highlight reels. And there's absolutely nothing wrong with that—some folks thrive on that kind of spotlight.</p>

            <p>But here in the <span class="drvn-badge">DRVN</span> ecosystem, I like to think of our trading style a little differently.</p>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">7</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Championship Rings</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">16</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">NBA Seasons</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p><span class="highlight">I like to call it the Robert Horry approach.</span> Robert Horry might not have been the flashiest player on the court, but he ended up with more championship rings than many of those big-name superstars. Why? Because he was consistent, reliable, and always delivered when it counted.</p>

            <p>He knew how to be efficient and play his role perfectly for multiple teams, ultimately making a huge impact in a way that wasn't always about being the star.</p>

            <div class="quote-box">
                We focus on being proficient, efficient, and consistent, rather than chasing the limelight.
            </div>

            <p>In the same vein, I see our trading journey as taking that Robert Horry path. We focus on being proficient, efficient, and consistent, rather than chasing the limelight. It's about those clutch moments, making solid decisions, and playing the long game to build a fruitful trading career.</p>

            <p>So while others might be aiming to be the MVPs, we're here to be the steady, clutch players who bring home the rings through consistency and smart plays.</p>

            <div class="closing">
                <p>Championship mindset. Consistent execution. Long-term success.</p>
                <div class="signature">— DRVN ECOSYSTEM</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
